{"parse": {"title": "TNV-07", "pageid": 28141, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TNV-06\" title=\"TNV-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TNV-07</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TNV</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A7.E5.B9.BD.E9.BB.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"旧幽默\">旧幽默</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 旧幽默</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Jest Anew</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>久<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>衰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>话<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>公<span class=\"color-value\"></span>元<span class=\"color-value\"></span>八<span class=\"color-value\"></span>世<span class=\"color-value\"></span>纪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190707</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旧故事终结，而新故事正要开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>永不熄灭的烛火燃烧着，暖黄色的光晕映照在听众的脸庞上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>现在，请允许某人再为诸位介绍一遍骑士笑话节的规则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>首先，需要有一块大场地，足够参会的所有人围坐在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人认为箱中大厅就很不错——嗯，这一点也许需要征求维尔汀的同意，她才是箱子的主人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哇，真系唔错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>每个参会的人都需要准备一些笑话……什么样的都可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>然后，这只绿色的小鸟会替我们决定顺序——简单地说，鸟喙指向谁，谁就是下一个说笑话的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未锈铠指向那只小鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>这是某人第一次与如此之多的朋友举行这一场盛会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>这也正是某人近日深感苦恼之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>时尚与风潮总是变得很快，某人新学的俏皮话总在过时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人还需要还收集一些题材，以便在即将到来的笑话节中大放异彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>sir，时代变啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>现代的人都喜欢听鬼故事！或许你试试讲一个鬼故事笑话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>保准又吓人又好笑啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未锈铠陷入沉思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某曾听到提托小姐说过一个关于苹果的笑话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>“现在的你在IT行业毫无价值，除非你被咬上一口。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某至今都不明白这个笑话的意思，IT【it】是大写的人称代词吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>这一点也不好笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>我对这些没什么兴趣……最令人轻松的消息就是一纸休假通知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾行者耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>但我会来参加这个节日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人深感荣幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经过简单的讨论，天色渐渐地暗了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>铠sir，我先回去了。明天早上还要出外勤噶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>我也要走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>希望某人不会令各位的期待落空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的客人们陆续离开了房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯火晃动，房间内又回到了最开始的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>APPLe先生，您是唯一听了两个故事的听众。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>相较而言，您更喜欢哪个故事呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某更喜欢那个拜访摩尔人女王的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>虽然您极力想为奥德骑士的故事营造出一个轻松、幽默、活泼的氛围——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>但敏感的读者依然能觉察到，事情的真相并不是如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人深表遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>那么，另一种结局又是什么样的呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗兰：</div><div>——不！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恒常之剑没入了菲尔格特的躯体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他竭力控制住颤抖且发软的双手，一寸一寸地拔出了剑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，他鼓起勇气看向了巨人的右手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只手紧紧握着，上面有些轻微的血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除此以外，再无他物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗兰：</div><div>……奥德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他忽然又燃起了希望，用所剩无几的力气，在附近寻找奥德的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四周只有寂寥的风声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看见远处飞来了一只鸟，它衔着奥德的绸带，飞向了更广阔的蓝天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只鸟通体绿色，有着几道长长的尾羽，胸腹是美丽的朱红色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">骑士Ⅱ：</div><div>罗兰阁下，我们在奥德女士的遗物中找到了一些信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-560820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">骑士Ⅱ：</div><div>上面的收件人是您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:left\">          罗兰阁下：</span><br />                  你阅读到这封信时，我应当已经迎来了我的终章。<br />                  我必须要声明，奥利弗实际上很喜欢你的笑话。<br />                  如果……你要向别人提起我，请一定给我一个有趣的结局——<br />                  相信我，我会听见的。<br />                  此外，愿你平安。<br />                                                                                 一位骑士</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>您一定读过希腊人的故事。他们就喜欢写这样的东西——没有一个人犯错，但悲剧还是不可避免地发生了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>在很久很久以前，那些年轻的骑士们很喜欢这样的故事，某人也受到了一定程度的影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某以为，骑士们会倾向于观看骑士小说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>年纪大点的骑士喜欢看骑士小说，他们会时常谈论里面的情节，并且以行内人的视角去嘲笑作者的外行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>同时，也会暗暗地将小说中写到的封赏与自己的酬劳相比较。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>很显然，现实的君主远不如杜撰的君主慷慨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>至于希腊人写的悲剧，一般更受年轻骑士的青睐……他们还没有经历过太多的战役，还处在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>嗯……用现在的话来讲，大约是……“青春期的躁动”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某认为，使用“对宏大叙事的憧憬”这个词更为贴切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>噢，是的，憧憬，他们的眼睛也说出了同样的词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无疑问地，他们向往战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吟游诗人拨弄着里拉琴，他们巧舌如簧，用曼妙的歌声将战争描绘成一幕盛大的戏剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那里，鲜血会编织成一条绛色的绶带。骑士们只需要将它佩戴在身上，黄金与声名便会如沙如土地向他们倾泻而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人曾经也是这样认为的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>直到那一场发生在龙塞斯瓦耶斯隘口的战役。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>那场战役，也是历史上所记载的，关于“罗兰”最后的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>奥利弗骑士亦随罗兰骑士一起上阵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>他从没有提起过，但某人知道，奥利弗骑士抗拒战场……或者，用“惧怕”这个词，更为准确些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>比起亲身参与战役，他更擅长作为一名幕僚而行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>但那场战役的状况是如此危急，四周围绕着将近四十万的敌人。他所效忠的君主就在身后，他不得不拿上武器，冲锋在前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>鏖战之中，他的眼睛被划伤了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>罗兰骑士见他受伤，便从巴斯克人中闯出一条路，驱马靠近了他，想要为他提供援助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>但他将罗兰骑士误认为来袭的敌人，一剑拍在了他的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>后面发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未锈铠望向了窗外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>请允许某人继续扮演那位“罗兰骑士”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>APPLe先生适当地调整了灯光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多年前的某日，一如此刻的黄昏，在遥远的隘口，有一场战役正在发生。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马甘尼斯驾驶着战马，手持长枪疾驰而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他借着由速度带来的惯性，贯穿了奥利弗骑士的躯体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-300713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-300713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-300713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗兰：</div><div>奥利弗！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罗兰骑士拼尽全力，赶到了奥利弗骑士的身侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的伤势非常严重，身体逐渐变得冰凉僵硬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>任何一个骑士都清楚地明白，受到这种贯穿伤不会有存活的可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>奇迹没有垂怜奥利弗骑士，他的躯体如同一个被打破的陶罐，寓意着生命的水流正源源不断地从中涌出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>他的遗言让罗兰骑士铭记至今。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>他说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">“没有眼睛的鹿……是什么鹿？”</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>一个非常老套的笑话。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这也是您进行的幽默化改编吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>不，这是一场真实的“小战役”，某人有幸是众多骑士中最普通的一员——因此，才能够亲耳听见这句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>APPLe先生，您无需抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>更何况，奥利弗骑士的英勇事迹已流传至今——某人相信，对于他而言，死亡远非终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人只是想陈述这样一个观点：笑话中所蕴含的能量，远比人们想象的要多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-300712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>箱子里需要更多的幽默与笑话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>所以……您愿意来参加下一届的骑士笑话节吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人准备于2月29日举办这个节日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>届时，某人将恭候您的光临。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">“谦卑、诚实、怜悯、英勇、公正、牺牲、荣誉、灵魂。”</span><br /><br />“当然，也包含了一点小小的幽默。”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TNV-07"}}